"SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "28068440806094162", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1921239611865139"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2929881140684099", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Vision Kiosk Player", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# V\u00eddeos imersivos profissionais no Meta Quest\n\nO **VR Vision Kiosk Player** transforma o Meta Quest em uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o confi\u00e1vel para v\u00eddeos 180\u00b0 e 360\u00b0, criada para eventos, exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, treinamentos, museus, showrooms e experi\u00eancias de marca.\n\n## Fluxo em modo quiosque\n\n- Tela de espera personalizada, pronta para o pr\u00f3ximo participante\n- In\u00edcio pelo bot\u00e3o do controle, Volume + ou gesto de positivo\n- Retorno autom\u00e1tico \u00e0 tela inicial ap\u00f3s cada sess\u00e3o\n- Sele\u00e7\u00e3o de um \u00fanico v\u00eddeo ativo no headset, sem playlist\n- Configura\u00e7\u00f5es persistentes de idioma, ID do evento, ID do headset e cobertura do trip\u00e9\n- Interface em ingl\u00eas e portugu\u00eas do Brasil\n- Diagn\u00f3stico e progresso no controle para a equipe do evento\n\n## Proje\u00e7\u00e3o e nome do arquivo\n\nA proje\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 detectada pelo nome:\n\n- Adicione **`_360`** para v\u00eddeo 360\u00b0, por exemplo `casa-02_360.mp4`\n- Adicione **`_180`** para v\u00eddeo 180\u00b0\n- Use `_SBS`, `_LR` ou `_3DH` para est\u00e9reo lado a lado\n- Use `_TB`, `_3DV` ou `_OverUnder` para est\u00e9reo superior e inferior\n- Sem marcador est\u00e9reo, o v\u00eddeo \u00e9 reproduzido em modo monosc\u00f3pico\n\n## Adicione seu v\u00eddeo\n\nCopie um arquivo compat\u00edvel para:\n\n`/sdcard/Android/data/com.vrvision.kisokplayervr/files/Videos/`\n\nAbra as Configura\u00e7\u00f5es pelo menu do controle esquerdo e escolha o v\u00eddeo que dever\u00e1 ser reproduzido.\n\n*O v\u00eddeo n\u00e3o est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo. A compatibilidade depende do codec e da resolu\u00e7\u00e3o aceitos pelo Meta Quest.*", "short_description": "Player profissional de v\u00eddeos 180\u00b0 e 360\u00b0 para Meta Quest, criado para eventos, exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, treinamentos e experi\u00eancias em modo quiosque."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Meta-icone-novo.png", "id": "37691423030471092", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_BACKGROUND", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_37691423070471088_5349673270830492937_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tRpAFNyZh-gQ7kNvwHSiqXH&_nc_oc=AdrMmW0-MmSOR-nMaAWD9HytQliPD76UfdV0S5dkyf-eo7Msl5BGfLGUuftjfSeK_jQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI6v-Kc6iRcwMm5iQpbsRgQ9D3DF6bQRSnavSswio8uJw&oe=6AA95155"}, {"file_name": "icone-lioskvr.png", "id": "2401142277046021", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_2401142280379354_1564528515856864418_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zLAfkEKPP2QQ7kNvwG76r_G&_nc_oc=Adprah5uZjxAV6RX0p_S6S_2O0chU8P_i1-yuU4mNQQ2aCodO8oD6Q2R_EJ2ETst61s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLQ66MILl9FqUo2VGMKxKBYbSqyh9aFJaVizW9oa97uYg&oe=6AA95F0F"}, {"file_name": "Kiosk-Hero-3000x900.png", "id": "2208758909981070", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_2208758913314403_3262921700237118020_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yAH7436EVhoQ7kNvwGvZhyf&_nc_oc=Adoe0-M4qvyu4kbINFTSFvDvdjE9UcuNYENhEEIASr4YSYuskVEpqC49xcjNUZ_1g34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJLIqAZjM2a3eiIK7v0kOFe08eC1j5lVzaB5uSvn2lh3w&oe=6AA95367"}, {"file_name": "Kiosk - cover Meta MQDH (1008\u00a0\u00d7\u00a01440\u00a0px).png", "id": "1777130906812494", "ima